<title>HONG KONG: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Wharf.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Wharf.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said on Wednesday it had launched 66 million American-style warrants on Wharf shares.</p>
<p>Ten warrants represent one Wharf share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$36.36	  PREMIUM	  9.5 PCT</p>
</text>
